-- table's normal state) hits it after it has become (category, locale). A literal `(category)` target
-- would raise "no unique or exclusion constraint matching the ON CONFLICT specification" in the second
-- case — see tests/integration/catch-up-parity.test.ts, which applies migrations then layers this
